airperson","org":"KNCCI Meru Chapter","description":"Serving as Vice Chairperson of KNCCI Meru Chapter, supporting sponsor relations and business networking.","image":"/images/committee/veronica-kihenja.jpg"},{"title":"William Wambugu","role":"Director","org":"KNCCI Meru Chapter","description":"Serving as Director, guiding strategic initiatives and chamber operations for the conference.","image":"/images/committee/william-wambugu.jpg"},{"title":"Patrick Kathurima","role":"Head of Marketing","org":"KNCCI Meru Chapter","description":"Leading marketing and communications for KNCCI Meru Chapter, promoting the conference and partner visibility.","image":"/images/committee/patrick-kathurima.jpg"},{"title":"Nicholas Ndeto","role":"Coordinator","org":"KNCCI Meru Chapter","description":"Coordinating chamber activities and member engagement to drive private sector participation at MIICCOF.","image":"/images/committee/nicholas-ndeto.jpeg"},{"title":"Martin Kiogora Mbui","role":"Secretary","org":"KNCCI Meru Chapter","description":"Representing KNCCI Meru Chapter as Secretary, coordinating chamber activities and member engagement.","image":"/images/committee/martin-mbui.jpeg"}]}'
